<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f5f3ee;">
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#f5f3ee;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center" style="padding:32px 12px;">
        <table role="presentation" width="480" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;max-width:480px;background:#f5f3ee;border:1px solid #c8c5bd;">
          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="background:#0a0a0a;padding:28px 40px;">
              <img src="https://scorely.ch/email/lockup-on-ink.png" width="160" alt="Scorely" style="display:block;width:160px;height:auto;border:0;"/>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:32px 40px 8px;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
              <h2 style="margin:0 0 12px;color:#0a0a0a;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;">Willkommen bei Scorely!</h2>
              <p style="margin:0 0 24px;color:#2a2a2a;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;">Dein Admin hat dir Zugang zu Scorely eingerichtet. Klicke auf den Button unten, um dein Passwort festzulegen und loszulegen.</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding:0 40px 24px;">
              <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;">
                <tr>
                  <td align="center" bgcolor="#ff3d2e" style="background:#ff3d2e;border-radius:999px;">
                    <a href="${link}" style="display:block;padding:14px 24px;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#0a0a0a;text-decoration:none;">Passwort festlegen</a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:0 40px 32px;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
              <p style="margin:0;color:#6b6b6b;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;">Falls du diese E-Mail nicht erwartet hast, kannst du sie ignorieren.</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding:20px 40px;border-top:1px solid #c8c5bd;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
              <p style="margin:0;color:#6b6b6b;font-size:12px;">Ball is in.</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
